### Login
POST http://localhost:8080/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"email": "ethel@test.com", "password": "Password123!"}

### Add a material
POST http://localhost:8080/manufacturer/materials
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer PASTE_TOKEN_HERE

{"name": "Cotton Fabric", "unit": "metres",
  "quantity": 3000, "minThreshold": 100, "costPerUnit": 2.50}

### Get all materials
GET http://localhost:8080/manufacturer/materials
Authorization: Bearer PASTE_TOKEN_HERE

### Create a recipe
POST http://localhost:8080/manufacturer/recipes
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer PASTE_TOKEN_HERE

{"productName": "Oxford Shirt", "unitLabel": "shirt",
  "groupLabel": "box", "unitsPerGroup": 24,
  "materials": [{"materialId": 1, "quantityPerUnit": 1.8}]}

### Calculate production
POST http://localhost:8080/manufacturer/production/calculate
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer PASTE_TOKEN_HERE

{"recipeId": 1, "targetGroups": 10}

### Confirm production
POST http://localhost:8080/manufacturer/production/confirm
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer PASTE_TOKEN_HERE

{"recipeId": 1, "targetGroups": 10}

### Get finished goods
GET http://localhost:8080/manufacturer/finished-goods
Authorization: Bearer PASTE_TOKEN_HERE